# Simulation Engine

Simulation Engine は本プロジェクトの中心となる。

```mermaid
flowchart LR

Env[Environment]

Org[Organization]

Agent[Agent]

Action[Action]

Interaction[Interaction]

Trust[Trust]

Knowledge[Knowledge]

Communication[Communication]

Network[Network]

Emergence[Emergence]

Env --> Agent

Org --> Agent

Agent --> Action

Action --> Interaction

Interaction --> Trust

Interaction --> Knowledge

Interaction --> Communication

Trust --> Network

Communication --> Network

Knowledge --> Network

